Current Limitations

- The application uses a console-based interface.
- It supports a fixed number of buses and seats.
- It does not include user login or authentication.
- It does not support multiple seats in a single booking.
- It does not include online payment integration.
- It does not maintain separate seat availability for different journey dates.

